mccloud - a tiny Minecraft server cloud

usage:
  mccloud init                                  create the cloud directory
  mccloud group create <name> <memoryMB> <port> <max>
  mccloud group list | group delete <name>
  mccloud template import <group> <server.jar>  set the jar of a group
  mccloud start <group>                         start a new instance
  mccloud stop <server>|all                     stop instances
  mccloud list                                  running instances
  mccloud cmd <server> <command...>             send a console command (screen)
  mccloud log <server> [lines]                  show the end of the log
  mccloud attach <server>                       open the console
  mccloud delete <server>                       stop and remove the instance

The cloud lives in ./mccloud-data (or $MCCLOUD_HOME).
